# Local NBA.com research data is restricted by NBA.com Terms of Use (Section 9:
# private, non-commercial use) and must never be uploaded. Without this file a
# `vercel deploy` from a local checkout uploads every file, including
# gitignored ones. Git-based deployments never contain this directory, so this
# entry changes nothing for them. See docs/nba-player-props-phase-2b-plan.md.
data/nba/
